@startuml
' DRAFT Developer,20.10.2026; implemented D007, InputSHA e0daa0e.
title DRAFT: implemented passive SVG, revision-local surface and copy/install
autonumber
hide footbox
participant "session.mjs / accept owner" as Session
control "facts.mjs + chart_state.mjs" as Facts
control "result_controller.mjs" as Result
participant "Retained HTML controls" as HTML
participant "Private live DOM adapter" as DOM
participant "Revision-local surface" as Surface
participant "wheel_svg.mjs" as Wheel
actor User
Session -> Facts : acceptanceSeq/cause/reset/submitted + accepted DTO
Facts -> Result : present(prepare, replace on new acceptance)
Result -> DOM : revoke old lease; detach its surface; remove imagery A
Result -> Facts : prepare outside leaf guard
Facts -> Facts : consume acceptance once; full-B S1 index/reconcile
Facts -> HTML : patch B facts/summary, keep live keyed controls
Facts --> Result : copied/frozen presentation snapshot
alt instance replacement
  Result -> Wheel : guarded dispose retired leaf, at most once
  alt dispose throws
    Wheel --> Result : retired diagnostic
    Result -> Result : retain HTML B; continue new draw
  end
else same instance, new revision
  Result -> Result : keep leaf, revoke old revision
end
Result -> Surface : create private connected measurement surface
Result -> Wheel : update(snapshot, captured publish, currentSurface)
Wheel -> Surface : native metrics / own root
Wheel -> DOM : captured publish(root)
DOM -> DOM : current guard; closed passive validation; clone
DOM -> DOM : recheck lease; validate clone; recheck; synchronous install
alt current valid
  DOM --> Wheel : true / copied root installed
else revoked or reentrant
  DOM --> Wheel : false; retain new accepted image
end
alt current factory/update sync throw or async rejection
  Wheel --> Result : local SVG failure
  Result -> DOM : revoke lease; clear imagery only
  Result -> HTML : visible local warning; retain facts B
else stale failure including delayed owner failure
  Wheel --> Result : retired diagnostic only
  Result -> Result : no B DOM/state/warning/safe-read mutation
else current controller/HTML failure
  Result -> Session : existing presentationFailed / safe-read
else success
  Wheel --> Result : settled
  Result -> Surface : retain until revoke
end
User -> HTML : native point/aspect activation
HTML -> Facts : canonical selection intent
Facts -> HTML : keyed patch, no planet focus/scroll call
Facts -> Result : new revision, same acceptanceSeq
Result -> Wheel : new frozen snapshot + lease
note over Session, Wheel
HTML/state own selection. Session alone mints acceptance/attempt/cause.
SVG has no controls/tabindex/Q44 and cannot issue HTTP.
Current late publish is allowed through the same guards; retired publish is refused.
37 native boundary controls, plus mounted whole-path checks; no independent acceptance.
end note
@enduml
